## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write: the
frame loop and the delta time it measures, the canvas fit, keyboard input, image
loading, audio cues, and the debug overlay. Where this specification speaks of
the runtime it means that layer, and it states only what Fathom needs from it.
How the layer is structured is yours to decide.
